<!--
We generate the files in this repo from a private repo. Edits here would
be overwritten by the next export. To suggest a change, open an issue or
a pull request. We'll make it in the private repo and re-export. See
CONTRIBUTING.md for details.
-->

<!doctype html>
<!-- Managed by Ansible. Do not edit by hand;
     change the role template.

     One HTTP response, start to finish. There is no script tag, no stylesheet
     link, no image and no font: the page renders the same with JavaScript off,
     with a text browser, and behind a blocker that eats third-party requests.
     The doubled-at markers below are filled in by the handler on every
     request. Its self-test refuses a page whose marker set does not match
     exactly what it fills, so a marker cannot reach a reader as literal text
     and a field cannot lose its value silently. -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>{{ listmonk_grant_form_title }}</title>
<style>
body { margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; max-width: 42rem; line-height: 1.5;
       font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;
       color: #222222; background: #ffffff; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
label { display: block; font-weight: bold; color: #222222; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
.description { display: block; color: #666666; margin: 0.2rem 0; }
input[type=text], textarea { display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
       padding: 0.5rem; font: inherit; margin-top: 0.3rem; }
.notice { border: 2px solid currentColor; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
.warn { border-left: 4px solid currentColor; padding-left: 0.8rem; }
button { font: inherit; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
.optional { font-weight: normal; color: #666666; }
.offscreen { position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px;
       overflow: hidden; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
{% include 'grant-form-logo.html.j2' %}
<h1>{{ listmonk_grant_form_title }}</h1>

<p>{{ listmonk_grant_form_intro }}</p>

@@NOTICE@@

<h2>Before you start</h2>
<p>Projects should be based in the {{ listmonk_grant_form_area }} (we can still look at one farther away). They have to be legal, and they should be doable within {{ listmonk_grant_form_completion_window }} of getting the money (a longer or ongoing project can still work).</p>

<p>{{ listmonk_grant_form_cycle_notice }}</p>

<p>Grants go up to {{ listmonk_grant_form_max_award }}. There isn't a minimum, and small asks are welcome!</p>

<h2>What happens next</h2>
<p>The committee reads every application. If yours makes the shortlist, we'll get in touch and invite you to pitch it to the community at a meeting.</p>

<h2>Filling this in</h2>
<p>Only the questions about your project are required. Everything about you is optional.</p>
<p>This form doesn't save drafts, so you might want to write the long answers somewhere else first.</p>

<form method="post" action="">
<input type="hidden" name="grant_form_token" value="@@TOKEN@@">

<p class="offscreen">
<label for="{{ listmonk_grant_form_honeypot_field }}">Leave this field empty.</label>
<input id="{{ listmonk_grant_form_honeypot_field }}" name="{{ listmonk_grant_form_honeypot_field }}" type="text" value="" autocomplete="off" tabindex="-1">
</p>

<h2>About you</h2>
<p class="warn">Everything in this section is optional. You can apply without giving any contact details at all (we just won't be able to tell you if you win).</p>

<label for="name">What should we call you? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
<span id="name-help" class="description">It doesn't have to be your legal name.</span>
<input id="name" name="name" type="text" value="@@V_NAME@@" aria-describedby="name-help" autocomplete="off">

<label for="email">Email address <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
<span id="email-help" class="description">Any email works. If you can, use one without your legal name or birthday in it, from a privacy-respecting provider like Tuta, RiseUp, or Proton. If firstname.lastname@gmail.com is all you have, that's fine too. We'll do our best to protect the data you give us.</span>
<input id="email" name="email" type="text" inputmode="email" value="@@V_EMAIL@@" aria-describedby="email-help" autocomplete="off">

<label for="phone">Phone number <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
<input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" inputmode="tel" value="@@V_PHONE@@" autocomplete="off">

<label for="signal">Signal username <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
<span id="signal-help" class="description">That's your username, not your display name. You can find it in Signal under Settings, then Profile.</span>
<input id="signal" name="signal" type="text" value="@@V_SIGNAL@@" aria-describedby="signal-help" autocomplete="off">

<h2>About your project</h2>

<label for="project">What's your project?</label>
<span id="project-help" class="description">A short description is fine. Required.</span>
<textarea id="project" name="project" rows="6" required aria-describedby="project-help">@@V_PROJECT@@</textarea>

<label for="why">Why do you care about it, and how will it help the community?</label>
<span id="why-help" class="description">Required.</span>
<textarea id="why" name="why" rows="6" required aria-describedby="why-help">@@V_WHY@@</textarea>

<label for="budget">Roughly what will it cost, and what's the money for?</label>
<span id="budget-help" class="description">Grants go up to {{ listmonk_grant_form_max_award }}, and there isn't a minimum. We don't need a line-by-line budget. If you already have other money or materials lined up, tell us about those too. Required.</span>
<textarea id="budget" name="budget" rows="6" required aria-describedby="budget-help">@@V_BUDGET@@</textarea>

<label for="resources">Anything else you need to finish it? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
<span id="resources-help" class="description">The Commons might be able to help, or point you to someone who can.</span>
<textarea id="resources" name="resources" rows="4" aria-describedby="resources-help">@@V_RESOURCES@@</textarea>

<h2>One more thing</h2>
<p>
<input id="subscribe" name="subscribe" type="checkbox" value="yes" @@SUBSCRIBE_CHECKED@@>
<label for="subscribe" style="display:inline; font-weight:400">Add my email to the {{ listmonk_grant_form_org_name }} mailing list too.</label>
</p>
<span class="description">We won't add you unless you tick this box.</span>

<button type="submit">Send my application</button>
</form>

<h2>What happens to what you type here</h2>
<p>Our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ listmonk_grant_form_data_notice_url }}">data policy</a> covers that. The code for our mailing list and for this form is on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ listmonk_grant_form_source_url }}">our GitHub</a>.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
